{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49628","headline":"定风波 一 · 李珣","name":"定风波 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"志在烟霞慕隐沦，功成归看五湖春。\n一叶舟中吟复醉，云水，此时方认自由身。\n花岛爲邻鸥作侣，深处，经年不见市朝人。\n已得希夷微妙旨，潜喜，荷衣蕙带绝纤尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}